      <title>Canada-EU Talks: Europe Has Far Too Many Hangers-On Already</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-09-12/canada-eu-talks-europe-has-far-too-many-hangers-on-already</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">3cb61ad04a7b99f237b02af1</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 07:00:02 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Next week, Canadian Prime Minister Mark Carney will address the European Parliament in Strasbourg. We all know why. He’s been forced onto the defensive by a hyper-aggressive White House, and has said his response will be to “build a much stronger and deeper security and economic partnership” with the European Union.</description>
